# `collections.update_item`

Replace a collection item's data.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.collection.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `collection` | `string` |
| `id` | `string` |
| `data_json` | `string` |

## Returns

`Item` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `collection` | `string` |
| `data_json` | `string` |
| `created_at` | `string` |
| `updated_at` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call collections.update_item --json '{ "collection": "", "id": "", "data_json": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "note-checkout-notes",
  "collection": "notes",
  "data_json": "eyJ0aXRsZSI6IkNoZWNrb3V0IG5vdGVzIiwiY29udGVudCI6IkF1dGggdmlhIEpXVC4ifQ==",
  "created_at": "2026-05-24T18:35:00Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-24T19:00:00Z"
}
```
